have to feel for the pulse.

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:33.842
If you don't feel the
pulse, that can just be

00:03:33.842 --> 00:03:35.950
pulseless electrical activity.

00:03:35.950 --> 00:03:37.891
It means that the heart has rhythm,

00:03:37.891 --> 00:03:39.312
and the electricity is
there but the heart's

00:03:39.312 --> 00:03:40.735
not completely beating properly

00:03:40.735 --> 00:03:43.230
to get the blood flow
going throughout your body.

00:03:43.230 --> 00:03:45.030
Patient's still in cardiac arrest.

00:03:45.030 --> 00:03:46.270
It means you have to keep going with your

00:03:46.270 --> 00:03:48.330
advanced cardiac life support.

