and we were unable to revive him.

00:03:52.908 --> 00:03:53.741
I'm sorry.

00:03:55.535 --> 00:03:57.157
- Bastard!

00:03:57.157 --> 00:03:58.240
You bastards!

00:04:01.380 --> 00:04:02.213
You're sorry?

